<title>USA: Astec to buy back up to 1.5 mln shares.</title>
<headline>Astec to buy back up to 1.5 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>CHATTANOOGA, Tenn. 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Astec Industries Inc on Monday said it approved a stock repurchase program up to 1.5 million common shares.</p>
<p>The repurchases were to be made from time to time on the open market at prevailing prices, the company said in a news release.</p>
<p>Astec makes asphalt-mixing plants, paving equipment, excavating and trenching equipment and related products.</p>
